.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor
*.swp
*~

# Tooling — this is a no-build static site. Nothing here should ever need npm;
# if node_modules appears in this repo, something was installed in the wrong
# directory. Build tooling belongs in a scratch dir outside the project.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
.vercel/

# Note: .superdesign/ is deliberately NOT ignored — it is tracked design
# documentation, not tool scratch.

# Internal strategy — this repo is PUBLIC, so committing this file would publish
# it on GitHub permanently, which a later delete would not undo. Ignored so a
# stray `git add -A` cannot stage it. The .vercelignore entry only stops Vercel
# from serving it; it does not stop a commit. If this repo ever becomes private
# and the file should be tracked, remove this line.
SEO-AI-PLAYBOOK.md
